---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';import {wa} from '@/data/site';
---
<Base title="Tarifas | CDA Los Andes" description="Tarifas de revisión técnico-mecánica en Ipiales."><section class="pageHero" style="background-image:url('/images/hero-tarifas.webp')"><div class="container"><p class="kicker">Información transparente</p><h1>Tarifas por vehículo</h1><p>Consulta los valores de referencia y confirma la tarifa vigente antes de visitarnos.</p></div></section><section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="price-list reveal"><article><span>01 / Motocicletas</span><strong>$220.000</strong><small>Valor provisional</small></article><article><span>02 / Vehículos livianos</span><strong>$320.000</strong><small>Valor provisional</small></article><article><span>03 / Vehículos eléctricos</span><strong>$240.000</strong><small>Valor provisional</small></article></div><p class="notice">Los valores son ilustrativos y deben sustituirse por las tarifas oficiales vigentes.</p><a class="btn primary" href={wa()} target="_blank">Confirmar tarifa ↗</a></div></section><style>.price-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.price-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .5fr .4fr;align-items:center;padding:30px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.price-list span{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.5rem;text-transform:uppercase}.price-list strong{font-family:var(--display);font-size:2.8rem}.price-list small{color:var(--muted)}.notice{margin:30px 0;color:var(--muted)}@media(max-width:650px){.price-list article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.price-list strong{margin-top:12px}}</style></Base>
